.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-GUIDE-IMAGE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-guide-image
.Nd render a Markdown document to a paginated, OCR-friendly PDF
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl -in Ar document.md
.Fl -out Ar guide.pdf
.Op Fl -title Ar T
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lays a Markdown document out as one text column per page \(em near-black text
on white, large type, wide margins \(em and writes the pages as a single PDF.
Each page is effectively a clean image of text.
.Pp
The use is handing a document to an AI chat
.Pq Gemini , ChatGPT , Claude
as one attachment instead of several loose files: the model reads or OCRs the
pages directly. An image of text is not cheaper in tokens than the text \(em
the win is packaging and surviving upload-only interfaces.
.Pp
.Xr vdots-listen 1 Ic publish
calls this on
.Pa document.md
automatically when
.Xr rsvg-convert 1
and
.Xr python3 1
are present, producing
.Pa guide.pdf
in the session directory.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--title T"
.It Fl -in Ar F
Markdown input. Frontmatter, headings, block quotes, lists, and fenced code
are rendered; inline emphasis and link markup are flattened to plain text.
.It Fl -out Ar F
Output PDF path.
.It Fl -title Ar T
Page-footer label. Defaults to the first level-one heading.
.El
.Sh OUTPUT
US-Letter proportions, one SVG-rendered page each, concatenated by
.Xr rsvg-convert 1
into a multi-page PDF. About 5 KB per page.
.Sh REQUIRES
.Xr rsvg-convert 1
.Pq librsvg ,
Python standard library only.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rsvg-convert 1 ,
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-listen 1 ,
.Xr vdots-publish 1
